If you are lucky enough to be in posession of a wand of teleport away
when you get into a shop, get ready for a great haul!!!

  - First, get a pile of stuff together at some point in the room.

  - Next, point your wand at it and zap.

  - Finally, leave the shop looking innocent, (and not paying one gold!)

Now comes the hard part.  You will have to truck all over the level,
collecting your booty, as it gets scattered when you zap.  Also,
apparently not all of the pile will be ported, I'm not sure exactly how
many items will go and I am going to have to check it out some more.

When you get back to the shop, you can sell it off for cold hard cash,
then start all over again!  The shopkeeper apparently does not feel that
he has been ripped off!

